,"html_url":"https://github.com/claude","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"claude","id":81847,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"34b4101b3dcf1ddadfc6cc11a4ed96aed0b5ac9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/New-UI-addition/commits/34b4101b3dcf1ddadfc6cc11a4ed96aed0b5ac9a","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhillashjadhav/New-UI-addition/commit/34b4101b3dcf1ddadfc6cc11a4ed96aed0b5ac9a"}]},{"sha":"34b4101b3dcf1ddadfc6cc11a4ed96aed0b5ac9a","node_id":"C_kwDOSHqyN9oAKDM0YjQxMDFiM2RjZjFkZGFkZmM2Y2MxMWE0ZWQ5NmFlZDBiNWFjOWE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2026-05-08T11:10:56Z"},"committer":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2026-05-08T11:10:56Z"},"message":"feat(signal): add Teams card preview + investigation console banner\n\nImplements the two RADAR Signal surfaces.\n\nDeliverable A — TeamsCardPreview at /preview/teams-card.\nRenders the Signal as it would appear in a Microsoft Teams channel:\nsender chrome, severity stripe, headline, score delta, revenue at\nrisk, confidence with expandable sources, three ranked\nrecommendations, and Investigate / Acknowledge CTAs.\n\nDeliverable B — SupplierDetail at /supplier/:id with optional\n?signal= query param. Without the param the screen is unchanged.\nWith the param a SignalBanner is pinned at top, the matching risk\ndimension is highlighted and scrolled into view, and Acknowledge\npersists dismissal in localStorage keyed by signal_id.\n\nThe Signal type at src/types/signal.ts is the contract for both\nsurfaces. The sample Signal targets Winn so the journey lands on\nthe placeholder host built from Winn's dimension data.\n\nAdds react-router-dom and small UI primitives (Chip, Card, Button,\nScoreBar) codifying tokens already used inline by App.tsx. No new\ncolour systems, fonts, or component libraries introduced.","tree":{"sha":"7db9fd77102c58947d1fa437bee8f4a4c9555e0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/New-UI-addition/git/trees/7db9fd77102c58947d1fa437bee8f4a4c9555e0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/New-UI-addition/git/commits/34b4101b3dcf1ddadfc6cc11a4ed96aed0b5ac9a","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQItj0po+\nUNaTiaHNM3xkJ3kWLHJpNuouiqzDc+6Em8kRD6TUFCQ8xqekymBWbe2DuJxsKVN4J1Ib0hQvC1tJ\nEgE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 7db9fd77102c58947d1fa437bee8f4a4c9555e0f\nparent c36c49118f62204454a9153a23da3424d0791d4c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778238656 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778238656 +0000\n\nfeat(signal): add Teams card preview + investigation console banner\n\nImplements the two RADAR Signal surfaces.\n\nDeliverable A — TeamsCardPreview at /preview/teams-card.\nRenders the Signal as it would appear in a Microsoft Teams channel:\nsender chrome, severity stripe, headline, score delta, revenue at\nrisk, confidence with expandable sources, three ranked\nrecommendations, and Investigate / Acknowledge CTAs.\n\nDeliverable B — SupplierDetail at /supplier/:id with optional\n?signal= query param. Without the param the screen is unchanged.\nWith the param a SignalBanner is pinned at top, the matching risk\ndimension is highlighted and scrolled into view, and Acknowledge\npersists dismissal in localStorage keyed by signal_id.\n\nThe Signal type at src/types/signal.ts is the contract for both\nsurfaces. The sample Signal targets Winn so the journey lands on\nthe placeholder host built from Winn's dimension data.\n\nAdds react-router-dom and small UI primitives (Chip, Card, Button,\nScoreBar) codifying tokens already used inline by App.tsx. No new\ncolour systems, fonts, or component libraries introduced.\n","verified_at":"2026-05-08T11:11:03Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/New-UI-addition/commits/34b4101b3dcf1ddadfc6cc11a4ed96aed0b5ac9a","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhillashjadhav/New-UI-addition/commit/34b4101b3dcf1ddadfc6cc11a4ed96aed0b5ac9a","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/New-UI-addition/commits/34b4101b3dcf1ddadfc6cc11a4ed96aed0b5ac9a/comments","author":{"login":"claude","id":81847,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/use